# graphify. The settings file holds an absolute path to this machine's Python
# Scripts directory, so committing it would push a hook that cannot run anywhere
# else -- including Railway. graphify-out/ is a build artefact of the source
# already in the repo and is regenerated with `graphify update .`.
.claude/
